<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Home' }) %>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>AFDrive</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Your device stays your storage. We just help people find and reach it.</p>
  <p>
    AFDrive turns any device you own — a phone, an old laptop, a Termux
    session — into your own personal cloud. The <strong>Agent</strong> runs
    on your device and keeps your files exactly where they are. AFDrive
    Online only handles discovery, login, and routing — never your files.
  </p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/directory">Browse public storages</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/signup">Register your own storage</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how-it-works">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Install the AFDrive Agent on the device that has your files.</li>
    <li>Pair it once with a code from your dashboard — no port forwarding.</li>
    <li>Decide whether it's public (discoverable here) or private (share-link only).</li>
    <li>Access it from any browser, anywhere, once you're authorized.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

